From d1ae332b87d1fa2eb177646e5193bf6293c8f9dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: DrakeRamorayJr <179530612+DrakeRamorayJr@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 21:43:29 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Bare: no blur behind the tab sheet or side drawer

Frosted glass no longer blurs the page behind the sheet: the window
background blur radius is always 0 and FLAG_BLUR_BEHIND is cleared in
every mode. Behind a bottom-bar sheet only the dim and the page-card
scale-back remain. The glass sheet surface is now opaque and equal to
the seam and toolbar colour, so the three read as one surface.
